Z||000000||pHoOl||05-06-2001||12:51 AM||||Alrighty here we go.  a friend and i were out, me in my baby, and him in a 9X Neon R/T with a stick.  He of course had to talk $hit, so i decided to have him put his money where his mouth was.<P>After a few miles of cruising, we finally hit a light red.  It was a long intersection, because the crossroad was somewhat diagonal to the road we were on.  Also, the two lanes that we were in merged into one after the intersection, so i knew that i could fight my way out of a ticket with out much problem saying that i was tryign to get over.  I also set up a 0-30 rule to help this factor out.<P>So it comes down to the light getting ready to turn green.  He's got his RPM's hiked up for a launch.  I dropped my auto into the 1 position and prepared for the green.  Soon as it hit, he spun the tires, and i launched.  Took her right up to thirty and had a good half a car length on him.<P>Granted, i know it's not a Mudstain, but... for 122k miles, i didn't think it was that bad.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||KnightRyder31||05-06-2001||12:55 AM||||A kill is a kill, good one man!<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Mach10||05-06-2001||01:43 AM||||Yeah, but it was a poor little Neon... That thing was already dead. Just too stupid to realize it yet  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> Neons suck the root. I have to admire cheapness and economy, but the next time some ass-clown comes up with a riced out NEON, I will start laughing hysterically.<BR>However, any punk-ass trying to talk shite without the muscle backin' him deserves to be put on "Da Kill-Lyst"<BR>Scratch One Neon!<P>I'm going to paint "notches" on my A-pillars  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I don't have many kill stories (cept in my jag  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) unless making rice-boys go red in the face counts...<P>1) My an' the Girl are cruizin' downtown, when I see this stupid looking blue Civic Hatchie with a Goat-Tube sticking out the back. As I get closer, I notice that he hase CANDY-APPLE RED WHEELS with Yellow brakes. I start laughing, and elbow the girlfriend. I give some instructions.<BR>So, with the stereo just cranked up (guaranteed to turn heads in the car next door, that's why) I mosey up. My Girl puts on the flawless act. I'm pretendin' to jam, staring straight ahead. She turns, looks at the driver for a few seconds (to be sure SHE has his attention) and then looks down. And laughs. Then elbows me, then I laugh. Mr. Rice (no more than 16) goes BEET red (darker than his wheels, anyway) and stares straight ahead, and takes the next exit.<P>2) I'm at a fill station, gettin' go-juice, when a riced out early 90's Acura Intergra pulls up, slammed to the ground. Too bad the read wheels were cambered in 45' I start laughing and laughing... Mr Rice_2 asks me if I had a ****ing problem, and wether I wanted to start something. I told him to get an a alignment, and to keep his fat-assed girl off the back of the car, 'cos it was bending his suspension. He may have tried something, except that his Drogues started laughing at him too. I just turned and paid my gas, still laughing. He didn't even fill up, just left. Don't know why, I ain't that huge.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
